# GitHub Linguist overrides
#
# The .ks extension is shared with KerboScript (Kerbal Space Program kOS), so
# Linguist misdetects Anaconda kickstart files. Force the Kickstart language and
# make it count in the language statistics (Kickstart is a "data" language, which
# is not detectable by default).
*.ks linguist-language=Kickstart linguist-detectable

# Unified-diff blank context lines contain one required literal marker space.
overrides/lorax/*.patch whitespace=-blank-at-eol
